target/
.git/
.claude/
*.pcap
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/

# What docker.yml's scan writes into the checkout between its smoke build and
# its push build: the Trivy DB cache and the SARIF report. In the context they
# changed what the builder's `COPY . .` copied, so the push build compiled
# sipnab a second time and the job ran into its timeout.
# tests/docker_build_context_test.rs reads these paths from the workflow.
.cache/
trivy.sarif

# Except the fuzz seeds. `.clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile` copies this checkout
# into the OSS-Fuzz builder image, and the build script packs
# `fuzz/corpus/<target>/` into the seed archives libFuzzer starts from. The
# exclusions above are right for the release image and silent here: the loop
# finds no directory, packs nothing, and reports success. Last match wins, so
# these must stay at the bottom.
!fuzz/corpus/
!fuzz/corpus/**
